            "line": 230,
            "text": "theorem gaussian_beats_Q_power {c : ℝ} (hc : 0 < c) (p : ℕ) (N : ℝ) :\n    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 < C ∧ ∀ n : ℕ,\n      (1 + ChartScales.S n) ^ p * Real.exp (-c * ChartScales.S n) ≤\n        C * ChartScales.Q n ^ N"
